  "releaseNotes": "Loam 3.21.0: Loam.Data DataGrid keyboard navigation — focused rows support Up/Down to move, Home/End to jump, Shift+Up/Down/Home/End to extend the selection (Multiple), Ctrl+A to select the rendered rows, and Esc to clear. Single mode selection follows focus; navigation stays within the current page. Cell editors and headers keep their own keys. Builds on 3.20 row selection. Additive. See https://araxis.github.io/loam/guide/changelog",
